        "text": "**Choosing a Provider**\n\nI've decided to use Google Cloud's Language client for text moderation within the `moderate_text.py` file. Now I will focus on integrating it correctly.\n\n\n**Implementing the Language Client**\n\nOkay, I'm now in the thick of things. I'm focusing on the integration of the Google Cloud Language client within `moderate_text.py`. I'm starting by initializing the LanguageServiceClient, and crafting the function to call moderateText. I will next create the document object from the input text.\n\n\n",
